//@version=6
//
// OUR CODE: rt_maker.pine with a fixed default quantity (a Live route refuses percent_of_equity,
// 5108) — the PL1 modify probe: a realtime limit entry that follows the close (Modify, E-7).
strategy("live maker (strategy-pine PL1)", overlay = true, default_qty_type = strategy.fixed, default_qty_value = 1)
plot(close)
if bar_index % 5 == 4
    strategy.cancel("L")
else
    strategy.entry("L", strategy.long, limit = close - 0.5)
